        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮<strong>TOKYO GAME SHOW 2025</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the “Sense of Wonder Night”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Winner of the &quot;Pocky Award&quot;, honoring the most streamer-friendly title!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A friendship tested by endless chaos...</strong><br><strong> A high-difficulty 2-player parking game where communication is everything!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗 <strong>Have a blast with friends in chaotic, high-stakes parking!</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/085479dd89f213bb8e5bb906dc3205db.poster.avif?t=1765870136\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/085479dd89f213bb8e5bb906dc3205db.webm?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/085479dd89f213bb8e5bb906dc3205db.mp4?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friend have one simple goal... &quot;park&quot; the car!<br>But be warned... this is no ordinary parking job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗<strong>One hit and it's over!</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/01e9d37e3c7fbc04af9983e33e98829e.poster.avif?t=1765870136\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/01e9d37e3c7fbc04af9983e33e98829e.webm?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/01e9d37e3c7fbc04af9983e33e98829e.mp4?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any collision means an instant explosion! Communicate clearly and give directions to survive the heart-pounding tension!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗<strong>You age outside the car!?</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/36c369a64caa25e3e9836ee60b21e42a.poster.avif?t=1765870136\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/36c369a64caa25e3e9836ee60b21e42a.webm?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/36c369a64caa25e3e9836ee60b21e42a.mp4?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step outside, and the aging timer starts ticking down! (And we all know what happens in the end...)Your time on foot is limited, so divide your tasks wisely and work together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗 <strong>Conquer the Challenge Mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/485bf0ba3832cd4f116ab4f37b4ba95e.poster.avif?t=1765870136\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/485bf0ba3832cd4f116ab4f37b4ba95e.webm?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/485bf0ba3832cd4f116ab4f37b4ba95e.mp4?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage features an ultra-hard &quot;Challenge Mode&quot;! In this mode, you'll need to collect all the medals scattered across the level before you can reach the goal... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/9d2ef34ef4bbfbbe0e1fc20c2f7a32ed.poster.avif?t=1765870136\" width=650 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/9d2ef34ef4bbfbbe0e1fc20c2f7a32ed.webm?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/9d2ef34ef4bbfbbe0e1fc20c2f7a32ed.mp4?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stages themselves have also been specially tuned, so once you've cleared the normal mode, dive in for even more chaos and tension!<i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚗Now Supports Solo Play!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All stages have been adjusted for solo play, so you can enjoy the game even by yourself!<br>Parking Together... even on your own!<br><br><br> <br><br><i>*Communication between players is essential for this game. We highly recommend using a voice chat service, as there is no in-game voice chat feature. Please consider this before purchasing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*We welcome streams, broadcasts, and video posts of this game! Monetization through partner/creator programs on platforms like YouTube and Twitch is also permitted.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*For all inquiries, please contact us at the following email address: <a href=\"mailto:contact.parking_together@yaneuragames.com\">contact.parking_together@yaneuragames.com</a></i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮<strong>TOKYO GAME SHOW 2025</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the “Sense of Wonder Night”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Winner of the &quot;Pocky Award&quot;, honoring the most streamer-friendly title!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A friendship tested by endless chaos...</strong><br><strong> A high-difficulty 2-player parking game where communication is everything!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗 <strong>Have a blast with friends in chaotic, high-stakes parking!</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/085479dd89f213bb8e5bb906dc3205db.poster.avif?t=1765870136\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/085479dd89f213bb8e5bb906dc3205db.webm?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/085479dd89f213bb8e5bb906dc3205db.mp4?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your friend have one simple goal... &quot;park&quot; the car!<br>But be warned... this is no ordinary parking job.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗<strong>One hit and it's over!</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/01e9d37e3c7fbc04af9983e33e98829e.poster.avif?t=1765870136\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/01e9d37e3c7fbc04af9983e33e98829e.webm?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/01e9d37e3c7fbc04af9983e33e98829e.mp4?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any collision means an instant explosion! Communicate clearly and give directions to survive the heart-pounding tension!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗<strong>You age outside the car!?</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/36c369a64caa25e3e9836ee60b21e42a.poster.avif?t=1765870136\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/36c369a64caa25e3e9836ee60b21e42a.webm?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/36c369a64caa25e3e9836ee60b21e42a.mp4?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step outside, and the aging timer starts ticking down! (And we all know what happens in the end...)Your time on foot is limited, so divide your tasks wisely and work together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚗 <strong>Conquer the Challenge Mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/485bf0ba3832cd4f116ab4f37b4ba95e.poster.avif?t=1765870136\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/485bf0ba3832cd4f116ab4f37b4ba95e.webm?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/485bf0ba3832cd4f116ab4f37b4ba95e.mp4?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stage features an ultra-hard &quot;Challenge Mode&quot;! In this mode, you'll need to collect all the medals scattered across the level before you can reach the goal... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/9d2ef34ef4bbfbbe0e1fc20c2f7a32ed.poster.avif?t=1765870136\" width=650 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/9d2ef34ef4bbfbbe0e1fc20c2f7a32ed.webm?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623330/extras/9d2ef34ef4bbfbbe0e1fc20c2f7a32ed.mp4?t=1765870136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stages themselves have also been specially tuned, so once you've cleared the normal mode, dive in for even more chaos and tension!<i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚗Now Supports Solo Play!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All stages have been adjusted for solo play, so you can enjoy the game even by yourself!<br>Parking Together... even on your own!<br><br><br> <br><br><i>*Communication between players is essential for this game. We highly recommend using a voice chat service, as there is no in-game voice chat feature. Please consider this before purchasing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*We welcome streams, broadcasts, and video posts of this game! Monetization through partner/creator programs on platforms like YouTube and Twitch is also permitted.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*For all inquiries, please contact us at the following email address: <a href=\"mailto:contact.parking_together@yaneuragames.com\">contact.parking_together@yaneuragames.com</a></i></p>",
